{
  "info": {
    "name": "用户管理联调（登录与昵称）",
    "description": "适用于当前 amadeus-oj 项目。已有管理员登录 → 新增测试管理员 → 新管理员登录 → 异常场景。当前 new_account 已存在时，02 会返回3101，请换一个账号开始新一轮。",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "用户管理联调（按编号执行）",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "01 已有管理员登录（自动保存 token）",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (!pm.environment.get(\"admin_account\") || !pm.environment.get(\"admin_password\")) throw new Error(\"请先在当前环境的本地值填写 admin_account 和 admin_password\");",
                  "pm.environment.unset(\"token\");"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 状态为 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "pm.test(\"业务码为 1000\", function () { pm.expect(body.code).to.eql(1000); });",
                  "if (body.code === 1000 && typeof body.data === \"string\" && body.data.split(\".\").length === 3) { pm.environment.set(\"token\", body.data); } else { pm.environment.unset(\"token\"); }",
                  "pm.test(\"返回完整 JWT\", function () { pm.expect(body.data).to.be.a(\"string\"); pm.expect(body.data.split(\".\")).to.have.lengthOf(3); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"userAccount\": \"{{admin_account}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{admin_password}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/sysUser/login",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "sysUser",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "01 已有管理员登录（自动保存 token）。按编号运行；接口路径在两种环境中共用。JWT 解码断言仅检查内容，不验证签名或 Redis 登录状态。"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "02 新增管理员（含中文昵称）",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (!pm.environment.get(\"token\")) throw new Error(\"请先运行 01 已有管理员登录，取得完整 JWT\");"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 状态为 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "pm.test(\"业务码为 1000\", function () { pm.expect(body.code).to.eql(1000); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"userAccount\": \"{{new_account}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{new_password}}\",\n  \"nickName\": \"{{new_nickname}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/sysUser/add",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "sysUser",
                "add"
              ]
            },
            "description": "02 新增管理员（含中文昵称）。按编号运行；接口路径在两种环境中共用。JWT 解码断言仅检查内容，不验证签名或 Redis 登录状态。"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "03 新管理员登录（检查 JWT 昵称）",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.environment.unset(\"new_token\");"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 状态为 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "pm.test(\"业务码为 1000\", function () { pm.expect(body.code).to.eql(1000); });",
                  "if (body.code === 1000 && typeof body.data === \"string\" && body.data.split(\".\").length === 3) { pm.environment.set(\"new_token\", body.data); } else { pm.environment.unset(\"new_token\"); }",
                  "pm.test(\"返回完整 JWT\", function () { pm.expect(body.data).to.be.a(\"string\"); pm.expect(body.data.split(\".\")).to.have.lengthOf(3); });",
                  "pm.test(\"JWT 中的 nickName 与新增昵称一致\", function () {",
                  "  const CryptoJS = require(\"crypto-js\");",
                  "  const payload = body.data.split(\".\")[1].replace(/-/g, \"+\").replace(/_/g, \"/\");",
                  "  const claims = JSON.parse(CryptoJS.enc.Base64.parse(payload).toString(CryptoJS.enc.Utf8));",
                  "  pm.expect(claims.nickName).to.eql(pm.environment.get(\"new_nickname\"));",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"userAccount\": \"{{new_account}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{new_password}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/sysUser/login",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "sysUser",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "03 新管理员登录（检查 JWT 昵称）。按编号运行；接口路径在两种环境中共用。JWT 解码断言仅检查内容，不验证签名或 Redis 登录状态。"
          }
        },
